sequenceDiagram
  participant Client as Client
  participant API as FastAPI app
  participant DB as PostgreSQL + pgvector
  participant Ollama as Ollama
  participant LLM as LLM

  Client->>API: POST /ask (question, filters) + JWT(user)
  API->>Ollama: embeddings(question)
  API->>DB: similarity search (cosine distance) with metadata filters
  DB-->>API: top-k chunks + sources
  API->>LLM: prompt(question_for_prompt + context)
  LLM-->>API: answer_text
  API->>DB: INSERT ask_events + audit_log (redacted query)
  API-->>Client: answer_text + sources

